r_b1:"Combines market analysis with learning-based strategy experimentation",projects_rl_crypto_trader_b2:"Built to test how autonomous agents behave under trading constraints",projects_lilibot_meta:"LinkedIn Application Automation Bot",projects_lilibot_pitch:"A job application bot designed to automate parts of the LinkedIn application process while keeping the workflow structured and trackable.",projects_lilibot_b1:"Built around repeatable application logic and answer reuse",projects_lilibot_b2:"Focused on speed, consistency and automation quality",projects_dilemma_royale_meta:"Game Theory / Simulation",projects_dilemma_royale_pitch:"An interactive game theory app built around the iterated prisoner's dilemma, with agent profiles, strategy tuning and replayable simulations.",projects_dilemma_royale_b1:"Turns an abstract theory problem into a more visual and playable system",projects_dilemma_royale_b2:"Designed to explore strategies, tension and emergent behavior",projects_ml_for_insurance_reserving_meta:"Thesis / Machine Learning",projects_ml_for_insurance_reserving_pitch:"A thesis exploring the application of machine learning methods to insurance reserving and provisioning problems.",projects_ml_for_insurance_reserving_b1:"Connects predictive modelling with a concrete actuarial context",projects_ml_for_insurance_reserving_b2:"Bridges analytical rigor and practical business use",projects_black_scholes_lab_meta:"Finance / Option Pricing",projects_black_scholes_lab_pitch:"A school project exploring Black–Scholes logic, market assumptions and trading-oriented interpretation.",projects_black_scholes_lab_b1:"Focused on financial modelling and pricing logic",projects_black_scholes_lab_b2:"Built as a bridge between theory and application",projects_brent_2023_econometric_study_meta:"Econometrics / Oil Markets",projects_brent_2023_econometric_study_pitch:"An econometric analysis of Brent oil dynamics in 2023 through a structured data and modelling approach.",projects_brent_2